      "content": "it's just not that simple. it's like... if i hadn't messed up, their lives would be so much better. if i wasn't here dragging them down and making them worry and feel disappointed, they could just be proud. instead, there's just this heavy, constant failure hanging over everything. sometimes i think it would be easier for everyone if i just wasn't a part of the equation anymore. if they didn't have to deal with the disappointment of me.",
